        <mxCell id="note_pi0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;rounded=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;Key Difference: Flow Matching (pi0)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Actions generated via iterative denoising (not AR tokens)&lt;br&gt;- PaliGemma VLM provides rich multi-modal context&lt;br&gt;- Action chunks: predict H future steps at once&lt;br&gt;- Flow log-probability replaces discrete logprobs in PPO&lt;br&gt;- Naturally outputs continuous actions (no binning)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SFT checkpoint:&lt;/b&gt; rlinf-pi0-sft-spatial&lt;br&gt;(pre-trained on LIBERO-Spatial demonstrations)" vertex="1">
